{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1445477-some-rotes-i-made-what-do-you-think","id":1445477,"title":"Some rotes I made - what do you think?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-23T06:48:33-07:00","id":1445477,"title":"Some rotes I made - what do you think?","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Celebrity Interaction Value Enhancement (Prime 2)</span></span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">There are things which are worth far more than they would seem to be at first glance. An old watch. A stamp. A knife. A gun. A worn base ball bat. That's when most people are wrong. In proximity to significant people and events, some of their value is 'rubbed off' onto the things near them. A worn baseball bat held by a sporting legend and autographed by him is worth thousands more than one made today out of fiberglass. A gun used to carry out the assasination of a dictator is a museum piece worth more than a normal modern pistol.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This Procedure lets anyone with Prime 2 enhance any weapon that has a 'history' or wielded by a 'great person'. Whether used by a Technocrat who is by very definition someone of great net value or an old weapon with a storied history (an old gun won't work. A musket used in the Battle of the Bull Run will).</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Yes, this might work with Gamer Girl Bathwater.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Applied Theory of Environmental Criminology (Mind 3, Entropy 2, Correspondence 3)</span></span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">'Lets change the character of this neighbourhood!'</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The broken windows theory is that an altered environment, whether it is signs of vandalism, trash, damage, or public drunkenness, will increase the crime rate and decrease social behaviour. This Procedure is putting that theory into practice. The mage carries out a week long alteration of the area, usually disguised as government workers or trashmen, or under the guise 'construction'. Tools can range from the mundane, to hypertech. Specialized perfumes and scents are deposited in the area, placed so air currents will carry them far and wide. Sound players, baffles, and altered building profiles change the sonic profile of the neighbourhood, driving residents to different behaviours. Altered lighting, graffiti, and window tinting combine to form subliminal messages at the very edge of perception. Trash bins, seating, debris, garbage, signposts, are all changed to match hyperpsych projections to later residents and their day to day routine, maximising exposure and effect.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This rote induces a Mind 2 impulse on everyone within the neighbourhood (defined as a few blocks). This can be things like 'report suspicious activity' or 'Obey the law' or 'Get angry'. Entropy 2 means that certain events and trends can be induced or reversed. The neighbourhood might obtain a new interest in science, or drive out Jehovah Witnesses, or be induced to a burst of patriotism or set off a witch hunt.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Data can be used to target specialized groups using electronic messages and social media. More powerful methods using Mind 3 and Life 3 can be used to attack certain communities, creating light patterns meant to interact negatively to Haemophage neurology, or paints and plants that are allergens to lupine shape-shifters.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">DAEMON MENTAL OVERRIDE (Mind 4/5, Data, Life, Prime)</span></span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">A favourite of the more ruthless members of the NWO and Syndicate. Mages and other such Reality Deviants tend to have Mind shields. Whether their own native hyperpsych, possession by EDEs, or altered neurology due to a blood-borne parasite. But those close to them? Far different. Sometimes you need an agent nearby who can break into a house to burn it down or muder a target. Sometimes, there is no agent, so you have to make one. Daemon Mental Override makes use of hyperpsych A.I programs and the ubiquitious electronic devices now in use everywhere. A target is chosen. Few friends. Few family. Usually male, adult, no physical defects. Then target is analyzed, isolated, and sent into a 24 hours 'meditative state' where the mind is overwritten by hyperpsychology and implanted hypnosis. The agent gains knowledge of their target and what they must do, with mnestic implants inuring them to pain and mental effects. Implanted biofeedback techniques and removal of limiters increase their physical capabilities. Data dumps are sent ino granting the now 'possessed' agent dots in tactics, terrorism, and weapons.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">It will strike at the first chance it gets, whether as a suicide bomber in a cafe or in a deadly hit and run. The agent is still mostly human and will die to any experienced combat mage. It is reckless because it must be, as the divergent mental state and neurology kill the Sleeper body after a week due to brain embolism and death. This has been used in great effect to stoke paranoia, drive Mages off any area with electronics, or destroy sympathizer operations in seemingly freak mass shootings.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","user":"Accelerator","date":". 04-24-2021, 08:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-29T12:48:06-07:00","id":1446481,"title":"","content":"I found them quite flavourful. I liled it. Routines really need their own mechanics, as it is they are almost non-necezsary by themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24274-menos125","name":"menos125","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-29T13:20:31-07:00","id":1446485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>menos125</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1445477-some-rotes-i-made-what-do-you-think?p=1446481#post1446481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I found them quite flavourful. I liled it. <b>Routines </b>really need their own mechanics, as it is they are almost non-necezsary by themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean rotes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-29T14:57:00-07:00","id":1446497,"title":"","content":"I think they're good, very impactful in terms of flavor. That last one. Knowing that is codified would make anyone super paranoid. <br /> I like the first one because it really gives a cool fluff for value in terms of Syndicate-esque power as was mentioned before in another thread.<br /> Great job, and would love to see more! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25226-knightfenrirwulfhart","name":"KnightFenrirWulfhart","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-23T18:57:26-07:00","id":1449410,"title":"","content":"<b>SZA-3051 (Sensei) and PRL-921 (Principal) units (Life, Mind, Entropy) </b><br /> <br /> The PRL-921 artificial intelligence program unit that specializes in interactions between humans, within humans, and emergent cultural properties arising from interactions between them and periodic injections of memetics. The SZA-3051 is a unit model of homunculi, with enhanced social and emotional intelligence, with a pDNA repository letting it teach anything from blacksmithing to aviation. Along with several upgrades that let it take care of rowdy students.*<br /> <br /> A combination of these two serves to act as a revolutionary new form of teaching and training programs, matching psychological profiles of perspective students with each other** and the specialized teacher***, introducing concepts and cultural thought patterns within isolated student groups to cause them to work together as a cohesive whole, along with a stiff regimentation of 'school life' that combined with the high empathy and prodigious knowledge of the SZA-3051 allows for a <i>training course that is far faster, more thorough, and lasts far longer</i> through the usage of memetic imprinting and association with positive and intense emotions. Even the most recalcitrant participants have been turned willing, overcome social anxiety or other negative psychological traits. Students and trainees have referred to it as 'passing in a single joyous blur' and 'happiest days of my life' or 'I wish I have never graduated'. ****<br /> <br /> Currently such programs required mass scaled isolation and careful monitoring, ranging from constant psychological analysis programs, surveillance, as well as isolation from the outside world. Access to the outside world is considered disruptive, as injection of new variables, thoughts, and desires into the main student body can cause social currents to move outside projections. Parents may introduce factors or subconscious changes that disrupt social harmony. Efforts are made to refine social theories such that this can easily apply in the world's education systems. HAIL THE SCHOOL.*****<br /> <br /> <br /> *Yes, the memetic omnicompetent teacher<br /> <br /> **Those with social anxieties are paired up with those who are more outgoing. Those who have a tendency to be brusque and overbearing interact with those more sensitive. Anti-social habits are muted and removed, while pro-social ones are enhanced and emphasized.<br /> <br /> *** Each teacher's method of training is different, but not this alone; it also includes a unique classroom culture, teaching materials, and perspective on what's being taught and what they are doing. Each student's classroom is not only tailored to them, but so is their individual interactions with other students. <br /> <br /> **** Check Addendum-05 for UNBIRTH GRADUATION for psychological evaluation and tactical manual<br /> <br /> ***** Current director of this program was a public school teacher from the inner city. Yes, that kind. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}